  <field_wiki_entry rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Massive terrestrial megastructure city constructed by the Global Government Organization in the Central Asian steppes. During the GGO Hegemony it became the primary population and administrative center of Earth. The original complex consisted of five concentric urban rings surrounding the central core district, separated by inhabited infrastructure belts and enclosed by the CoG Outer Wall. Later phases expanded beyond the original structure into additional outer habitation and production districts.

City-layer aggregate entry. Geography remains on the linked location entry. Urban systems, structural districts, social organization, and internal city capabilities are represented here.
</field_wiki_entry>
