  <entityType rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">institution</entityType>
  <field_card_color rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">#1b1005</field_card_color>
  <field_name rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Project Deep Sleep</field_name>
  <field_pretty_name rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Project Deep Sleep</field_pretty_name>
  <field_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">institution</field_type>
  <field_wiki_entry rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">! General

Project Deep Sleep orginated from the concern that centralization was a positive movement as a whole from a whole [[fac_ggo_hegemony]] perspective, however also put all eggs in one basekt.

In order to counter the potential for civilizational collapse due to a compromization of the central location, most wares produced by the GGOfoudn themselves present in [[idea_deep_earth_storage]] facilities.

! DES Sites
!! [[loc_des_1_underways]]
</field_wiki_entry>
  <listFieldName rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">related</listFieldName>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

