  <field_population_notes rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Particularly successful on lower-diversity Earth-like seeded worlds, where it expanded into many available niches and became one of the dominant engineered vertebrate lineages.</field_population_notes>
