  <field_tags rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">ceag</field_tags>
  <field_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">species</field_type>
  <field_wiki_entry rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Bioengineered parrot-derived theropod lineage created by the Terran BDP during the Planetary Period as an omnivorous generalist. On at least one seeded Earth-like world with reduced biodiversity, later exposure to CEAG drove rapid diversification into predator and generalist branches across nearly all major ecosystems.</field_wiki_entry>
