  <field_wiki_entry rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Reusable Mars orbit-to-surface cargo lander used during the Race for Sol for freight delivery between orbital logistics hubs and surface landing pads.

The class is built around repeated cargo descent and unloading operations on Mars. The design uses detachable modular lifting wings that can be removed and remounted in reversed orientation depending on mission profile and servicing state.
</field_wiki_entry>
